# direnv: load the dev shell defined in flake.nix on every `cd` into the
# workspace. Requires `nix-direnv` to be installed and hooked into your
# shell — see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md for setup.
use flake

# Also export the WiFi credentials from `.env` (if present) into the shell,
# so `cargo build` sees EZAL_WIFI_SSID / EZAL_WIFI_PASSWORD in its
# environment. build.rs reads `.env` directly too, so this isn't required for
# a build — it just makes the values available to anything else in the shell
# and keeps `.env` the single place credentials live. `.env` is git-ignored.
dotenv_if_exists
